ons will make the garbage beans appear in the competitor’s play board. The player who persevere to the last will win the game.","released":"Apr 16, 2020","updated":"2026-08-30","icon":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9pONCE2B_9QYAbn82INvHlI0rpPlcPlhLhXPPwtRTUTXOjP7Nbg2nK2MeFjicSJVc8efEZXvCNd4Kld2RZ5CFw","age":"Everyone"},"icon":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9pONCE2B_9QYAbn82INvHlI0rpPlcPlhLhXPPwtRTUTXOjP7Nbg2nK2MeFjicSJVc8efEZXvCNd4Kld2RZ5CFw","cat":"Games","rating":3.99,"ratings":629,"mentions":1,"users":1,"threads":1,"hn_points":1,"hn_comments":2,"submissions":1,"self_n":1,"hn_score":2.58,"first":1589212586,"last":1589212586,"show_hn":null,"n_lab":0,"pos_pct":null,"neg_pct":null,"mood":null,"quotes":[{"id":23143461,"k":"android:com.puyo.magic","type":"story","by":"puyo","time":1589212586,"text":"","title":"Puyo puyo like Android game","story_id":23143461,"story_title":"Puyo puyo like Android game","story_score":1,"comments":2,"w":2.585,"u":-1,"s":"pos","self":true}],"slug":"magic-bean-drop-puzzle"}